<view class="prototype-page notifications-page">
  <subpage-header/>
  <view class="prototype-title page-title">消息提醒</view>
  <view class="page-caption">点菜和上菜的消息，都留在这里。</view>
  <view class="prototype-card subscribe-card {{canSupplement?'':'subscribe-card-closed'}}" bindtap="subscribe"><view><view class="subscribe-title">补充微信提醒</view><text>{{templateHint}}</text><text wx:if="{{creditHint}}">{{creditHint}}</text></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{configured}}" class="prototype-card test-card">
    <view class="test-heading">测试微信提醒</view>
    <view class="test-caption">发送给当前登录的微信账号；每次测试会消耗对应模板的一次提醒机会。没有机会时，点击后会先申请该模板授权。</view>
    <view class="test-actions">
      <button class="test-button" data-event="created" bindtap="sendTest" loading="{{testingEvent==='created'}}" disabled="{{!testReady || testingEvent}}">测试点菜提醒</button>
      <button class="test-button" data-event="served" bindtap="sendTest" loading="{{testingEvent==='served'}}" disabled="{{!testReady || testingEvent}}">测试做饭完成</button>
    </view>
    <view class="test-caption">“已请求发送”表示微信接口已接受请求，不代表消息一定已送达或已读。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-head"><text>饭桌消息</text><text wx:if="{{unreadCount}}" bindtap="markRead">全部标为已读</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在看看有什么新消息…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="prototype-card state"><view>{{error}}</view><button bindtap="load">重新试试</button></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!items.length}}" class="prototype-card state">还没有新消息，一起点一顿饭吧。</view>
  <view wx:else class="prototype-card message-list">
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="message-item" data-id="{{item.orderId}}" bindtap="openOrder">
      <view class="message-dot {{item.readAt?'read':''}}"/>
      <view class="message-copy"><view>{{item.title}}</view><text>{{item.content}}</text><text class="message-time">{{item.createdAt}}</text></view>
      <text class="chevron">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="tip">预计次数按本小程序记录，微信不提供准确余额。每类最多保留10次；满额后会跳过该模板的授权申请，发送消耗后可再次补充。站内消息会一直保留。</view>
</view>
